\\ zeropage.6502 - the code that runs in zero page (D24): the routines whose hot loops run on operands they
\\ patch (or have patched), so each patch is a zero page store, 3 cycles and 2 bytes. The loader copies it
\\ to ZeroCodeOrg from its image in the payload, where the near and merge lists go once the game runs
\\ (LowSpace: scratch until then).

